{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Only the gold, etc.</b> Even though Moses instructed you only in the laws of impurity, there is still to instruct you in the laws of absorptions — and 'אַךְ' is a term of restriction, meaning: you are restricted from using the vessels even after their purification from corpse-impurity until they are purified from the absorption of forbidden carrion. And our Sages said: <b>'Only the gold'</b> — to say that one must remove its rust before performing the absorption-process upon it. And this is the sense of <b>'אַךְ'</b>: there must be no rust there — only the metal should be as it is."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:13:26.622078067Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}